en:
{FA:FF0101}{call:@2BAB}
I'm the {call:@2B27} of the North
Pacific kingdom.{FA:06}I came to the world above to find my
pink pearl, the proof that I'm
a {call:@2B32}.
{FA:FF0100}{end}

{FA:FF0101}{call:@2BAB}
There's a festival tonight!{FA:06}{FA:FF0301}But even though {call:@2AEA} invited me, I get
so nervous and flustered in front of
{call:@2AE7} that I can't even sing properly...
{FA:FF0100}{end}

{FA:FF0111}What's going on, {call:@2A5B}? Why'd you
bring Jennifer all the way out here?
{FA:FF0110}{end}

jp:
{FA:FF0111}たいへん！　ふたりが、おおなみに
さらわれちゃった！{FA:06}{call:@2A5B}、はやくたすけないと！
{FA:FF0110}{end}

en:
{FA:FF0111}Oh no! A huge wave swept the two of
them away!{FA:06}{call:@2A5B}, we have to save them, quick!
{FA:FF0110}{end}

jp:
{FA:FF0101}{FA:FF0300}なにこれ？
……ピアノコンサートのチケット？
{FA:FF0100}{end}

en:
{FA:FF0111}Yup! I got them from {call:@2B54}-chan! And
{call:@2B4F}-chan's playing in it too, he says!
{FA:FF0110}{end}

jp:
{FA:FF0101}{call:@2AE7}……………。{FA:06}{FA:FF0100}{call:@2AE7}のこころのなかにいるのは、
{call:@2B32}のすがたをした、
もうひとりのあたし。{FA:06}いいたいのに、いえない……。{end}

en:
{FA:FF0101}...It was sunny just a moment ago, and
suddenly a storm's blowing in...{FA:06}{FA:FF0303}Oh no! The candle's going to go out!
{FA:FF0301}{FA:FF0100}{end}

{FA:FF0111}Hey, that's dangerous, {call:@2A5B}! Where do
you think you're going?!{FA:06}......I'll go check on the candle for you!
{FA:FF0110}{end}

{FA:FF0101}For some reason, everyone at this
year's contest keeps wiping out!{FA:06}{FA:FF0301}{call:@2AE7}'s up next... I hope he's okay...{FA:06}He didn't even eat my lunch...
{FA:FF0100}{end}

jp:
{FA:FF0111}……うん？{FA:06}{call:@2A5B}、いま、なみがこおって
なかったか？
{FA:FF0110}{end}

en:
{FA:FF0101}Huh? {call:@2A96}, really?{FA:06}Could this be their doing?{FA:06}{FA:FF0302}If they're getting in {call:@2AE7}'s way, I'll
never, ever, eeever forgive them!
{FA:FF0100}{end}

{FA:FF0101}I'm {call:@2A82}.{FA:06}{call:@2A5B}, how did your "Operation
Homemade Lunch" go the other day?
{FA:FF0100}{end}

{FA:FF0111}Yeah, it was a huge success! {call:@2AEA}
even said it was "delicious"!
{FA:FF0110}{end}

{FA:FF0101}Hellooo, {call:@2B3F}! I made you a
boxed lunch~!{wait}{FA:FF0301}Huh...? The one collapsed in front of
the piano is...{end}

jp:
{FA:FF0111}だって、{call:@2A96}がおしゃれしたところ
みてみたいんだもん！
{FA:FF0110}{end}

en:
{FA:FF0111}But I really wanna see {call:@2A96} all
dressed up!
{FA:FF0110}{end}

